{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/RunYourComicStore.png?t=1748207567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order stock, fill the shelves, hire some extra help and arrange the store however you wish. Increase your relationship with publishers to unlock new products and keep the customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/UnboxGif.gif?t=1748207567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/CollectRareComics.png?t=1748207567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each comic has many different cover variants to collect. With a total of over 100, start hunting those illusive rares and complete your collection. There are also out-of-print retro comics available only through auctions - happy hunting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/RaresGif.gif?t=1748207567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/OrganizeEvents.png?t=1748207567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host meet and greet events with superheroes and autograph signings with authors. Earn bonuses during the events to increase sales for the respective publisher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/EventGif.gif?t=1748207567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/AdvertiseYourHeroes.png?t=1748207567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pay to promote your favorite hero on billboards throughout the street. Running these advertisements will increase sales and interest for the duration of the promotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/AdvertisingGif.gif?t=1748207567\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557190?t=1748207567","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557190?t=1748207567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/92e0a9abb87bf79c704ce04bbf5df7079bcf54af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748207567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/92e0a9abb87bf79c704ce04bbf5df7079bcf54af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748207567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/RunYourComicStore.png?t=1748207567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order stock, fill the shelves, hire some extra help and arrange the store however you wish. Increase your relationship with publishers to unlock new products and keep the customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/UnboxGif.gif?t=1748207567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste